  "title": "Orc 1.95 m",
  "description": "A green orc brute with tusks, belt and hair. Low-poly character by Quaternius (CC0 1.0, public domain), from the animated model used in the KherveOS games, here in its rest pose. 1950 mm tall (1999 x 1128 x 1950 mm), standing on z = 0, centred on x/y, facing -Y. Built as one Object of 10 coloured imported meshes (STL files in meshes/orc/ beside this part); scale the Object to resize it. 7344 triangles.",
